[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごいぞ、真乃！　『W.I.N.G.』出場決定だ！\r\nあの大舞台に立てるんだぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070010,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほ、本当に……\r\nあの『W.I.N.G.』に、出られるんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃が積み重ねた努力の結果だ\r\nここまでよくがんばったな！",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070020,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はいっ、ありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070030,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ここまでくるのに\r\n本当にいろいろなことがありました……本当に……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070040,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私ってアイドルになる前は、お友達とか少なくて……\r\nこのままでいいのかなって思っていたり……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そんなときアイドルをやってみないかって、\r\nプロデューサーさんが誘ってくれたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、最初は断られたけど、粘ったんだよな",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070060,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "真剣に誘ってくれたので、やってみようって思いました\r\nアイドルになれば何か変わるかもしれない……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070070,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "でも……どこか流されたみたいにアイドルを始めたから、\r\n自信なんか全然なくて……何も変わらないままで……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "それでもプロデューサーさんは励ましてくれたから、\r\nああ、この人を信じていこうって、頑張ってきましたっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、真乃が努力してるところは、\r\nちゃんと見てたからな",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "応援してくれる人がたくさん増えました\r\n事務所のみんなとは仲良くなれましたし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "今の私があるのは、プロデューサーさんや\r\n応援してくれるみなさんのおかげです",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みなさんが私を信じてくれたから、\r\n私はここまで頑張れました……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "けど、今日からは自分のことを……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070130,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "みんなが応援してくれる私のことを……\r\nちょっとだけ信じてみようと思いますっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……自分を信じる、か……\r\n真乃も立派なアイドルになったんだな……",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、もう俺が言うことは何もないな\r\n後は『W.I.N.G.』の本選に向けて調整するだけだ！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7001001070140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "はい、見ててくださいね、プロデューサーさん\r\nむんっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700100107/7001001070140"
  },
